00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:58,880
You should have a passing familiarity with some of the personal

155
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:01,320
history of the founder of Scouting, Baden Powell.

156
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:06,800
He was born on the 22nd of February in 1857, which is Duke

157
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:12,560
little quick math- 159 years ago in Paddington London, England.

158
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:18,880
His family called him Stevie and his father died when he was three

159
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,960
And, as a tribute to his father, his mother changed their family

160
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:24,480
name to the hyphenated Baden Powell.

161
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:28,760
Stevie went on to become a soldier and an officer in the British Army

162
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:32,840
and became a national hero for his part in the Boer War

163
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:35,680
in South Africa in 1900..

164
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:40,920
He returned to England in 1903 to find that a military training

165
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:46,040
manual that he had written, called AIDS to Scouting, had become a real

166
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:48,720
bestseller and it was being used by teachers and youth

167
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,400
organizations all over Great Britain.

168
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:55,360
He decided to rewrite AIDS to Scouting for a youth audience

169
00:10:55,400 --> 00:11:00,920
And in August of 1907, he held a camp on Brown Sea Island right

170
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:05,200
there in Pool Harbor in southern England for 20 boys to test

171
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,280
out his ideas.

172
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:11,680
And then he published Scouting for Boys in six installments in 1908.

173
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:16,560
And that book has sold approximately 150 million copies

174
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:20,480
and is the fourth bestselling book of the 20th century.

175
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:24,560
And soon this became an international phenomenon.

176
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:29,040
By 1922, there were more than a million scouts in 32 countries.

177
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:33,480
By 1939, the number of scouts was an excess of 3.3 million.

178
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:37,440
If you're interested in BP's personal history, author Tim

179
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:41,440
Jill wrote a book called Baden Powell, Founder of the Scouts,

180
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:44,240
And it is perhaps the most authoritative and, some would

181
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:48,040
say, in not a completely complimentary way, most exhaustive

182
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:52,640
of the many biographies of Baden Powell available.

183
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,800
I've read it. It's a pretty good read.

184
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:59,320
It's a very academic biography of 700 plus pages.

185
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:03,360
If you really want a detailed account of his life, that's a great read

186
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:06,960
And I'll have a link to Tim Jill's book in the podcast notes.

187
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:12,840
Like any man, any famous man, any celebrity, any influential man,

188
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:18,000
Baden Powell was in part a product of his times, as was his outlook.

189
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:21,720
Now, if you look close at Baden Powell, you'll find dated

190
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:24,680
attitudes about culture and race and gender,

191
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,480
But you'll also find his genius.

192
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:32,680
You'll find the foundational ideas that he synthesized

193
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:37,120
from his own experience and the work of men like Ernest Thompson Seton

194
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:40,720
into what would become the worldwide scouting movement.

195
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:45,360
And time has tested those ideas, as has the experience

196
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:48,800
of tens of millions of men and women who've become scouts

197
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:51,440
and scouters over more than a century

198
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:56,680
Now. perhaps the best distillation of what Baden Powell was aiming at

199
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,760
when the scouting movement came into being.

200
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,080
It's kind of interesting to call him a founder.

201
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:05,480
I don't know how accurate that is, because I don't think he had any

202
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:08,560
intention of founding this worldwide movement.

203
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,640
I think it was almost an accident.

204
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:14,840
I think it was the power of the ideas that he put into scouting

205
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:20,280
for boys, just kind of touched off this, this worldwide phenomenon

206
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:22,600
that just sprouted up spontaneously.

207
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:25,680
And at the first World Jamboree, more than 10 years

208
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:29,520
after the publication of the book that, he was kind of acclaimed-

209
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:33,800
And, I think, probably rather reluctantly- to be the chief scout

210
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:37,160
of the world and they opened up a world scouting office

211
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:41,520
And I kind of get the impression that he was a reluctant founder,

212
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,000
to tell you the truth.

213
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:47,040
But, that being said, his ideas still motivate scouts all over the world

214
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:50,800
And, as I said, the probably the best distillation of those ideas

215
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:54,400
that have stood the test of time are in a very thin book

216
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,600
called AIDS to Scout Mastership.

217
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:59,199
I'll have a link to that in the podcast notes

218
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:03,120
And I've, as I've said many times, I think AIDS to Scout Mastership

219
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,760
is kind of required reading.

220
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:08,920
OK, the language is a little stilted and a product of its time,

221
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:14,960
But it's worth reading because there you see the foundational ideas

222
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:19,040
of scouting, ideas that spawned this incredible movement

223
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:22,319
that's still alive and still vital in the lives of people

224
00:14:22,319 --> 00:14:23,920
a hundred years later.

225
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:27,319
Shortly before his death in Kenya in the 1940s,

226
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,760
Baden Powell wrote this:

227
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:33,400
The movement has already, in the comparatively short time

228
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:38,120
of its existence, established itself on a wide and so strong

229
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:41,280
of footing as to show most encouraging promise

230
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:43,920
of what may be possible to it in the coming years.

231
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:48,080
Its aim is to produce healthy, happy, helpful citizens

232
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:52,320
of both sexes, to eradicate the prevailing narrow self interest-

233
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,960
personal, political, sectarian and national-

234
00:14:56,360 --> 00:15:00,160
and to substitute for it a broader spirit of self

235
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:03,360
sacrifice and service in the cause of humanity,

236
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:07,320
and thus to develop mutual goodwill and cooperation,

237
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:12,160
not only within our own country, but abroad, between all countries.

238
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,880
Experience shows that this

239
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:17,160
consummation is no idle or fantastic dream,

240
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:21,120
but is a practicable possibility if we work for it,

241
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:24,800
And it means, when attained, peace, prosperity

242
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:26,600
and happiness for all.

243
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:32,000
Therefore, you who are scouts and guide are not only

244
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,160
doing a great work for your neighbor's children,

245
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:37,920
but are also helping in practical fashion

246
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:41,960
to bring to pass peace and goodwill on earth.

247
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:45,760
So, from my heart, I wish you Godspeed in your effort

248
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:49,760
And in that spirit. everyone happy Founders Day.

